{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/fixed_point_and_floating_point/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"2cd023cf-6470-5f97-83b1-8341078f6472","html":"<h1 id=\"고정-소수점--부동-소수점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B3%A0%EC%A0%95-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90--%EB%B6%80%EB%8F%99-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"고정 소수점  부동 소수점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>고정 소수점 &#x26; 부동 소수점</h1>\n<p>컴퓨터에서 실수를 표현하는 방법 → 고정 소수점 / 부동 소수점</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 308px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 62.77777777777778%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"소수점 방식\"\n        title=\"소수점 방식\"\n        src=\"/static/78e64ea489b790829005ff076ae084a4/2ece4/points.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/78e64ea489b790829005ff076ae084a4/e9ff0/points.png 180w,\n/static/78e64ea489b790829005ff076ae084a4/2ece4/points.png 308w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 308px) 100vw, 308px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span><br>\n<br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"고정-소수점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B3%A0%EC%A0%95-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"고정 소수점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>고정 소수점</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 8.333333333333332%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"고정 소수점\"\n        title=\"고정 소수점\"\n        src=\"/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/37523/fixed_point.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/e9ff0/fixed_point.png 180w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/f21e7/fixed_point.png 360w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/37523/fixed_point.png 720w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/302a4/fixed_point.png 1080w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/07a9c/fixed_point.png 1440w,\n/static/5ad0caf2975756f4566ad47001b142b2/fbd44/fixed_point.png 2215w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>소수부의 자릿수를 미리 정해 고정된 자릿수의 소수를 표현</li>\n<li><strong>부호비트(1비트)</strong> - 실수가 음수면 부호비트에 1, 양수면 0 넣음</li>\n<li><strong>정수부(15비트)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>소수부(16비트)</strong></li>\n<li>정수부와 소수부의 경계를 소수점의 위치로 생각하고 2진수로 변환된 수 넣음</li>\n<li>정수부와 소수부의 자릿수가 크지 않으므로 표현할 수 있는 범위가 적음</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"부동-소수점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B6%80%EB%8F%99-%EC%86%8C%EC%88%98%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"부동 소수점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>부동 소수점</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 8.333333333333332%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"부동 소수점\"\n        title=\"부동 소수점\"\n        src=\"/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/37523/floating_point.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/e9ff0/floating_point.png 180w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/f21e7/floating_point.png 360w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/37523/floating_point.png 720w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/302a4/floating_point.png 1080w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/07a9c/floating_point.png 1440w,\n/static/d1d2978d0a8e94c1c5dc21e05bacdb8c/fbd44/floating_point.png 2215w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>가수부와 지수부로 나누어 표현</li>\n<li><strong>부호비트(1비트)</strong> - 실수가 음수면 부호비트에 1, 양수면 0 넣음</li>\n<li>지수<strong>부(8비트)</strong> - 정규화 과정에서 얻어낸 지수에 bias를 더한 값</li>\n<li>가수<strong>부(23비트)</strong> - 소수 부분의 값</li>\n<li>매우 큰 실수까지 표현 가능</li>\n<li>대부분의 시스템에서 사용 중인 방식</li>\n<li>오차 발생 가능성</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://gguguk.github.io/posts/fixed_point_and_floating_point/\">https://gguguk.github.io/posts/fixed_point_and_floating_point/</a></p>","excerpt":"고정 소수점 & 부동 소수점 컴퓨터에서 실수를 표현하는 방법 → 고정 소수점 / 부동 소수점   고정 소수점  소수부의 자릿수를 미리 정해 고정된 자릿수의 소수를 표현 부호비트(1비트) - 실수가 음수면 부호비트에 1, 양수면 0 넣음 정수부(15비트) 소수부(16비트) 정수부와 소수부의 경계를 소수점의 위치로 생각하고 2진수로 변환된 수 넣음 정수부와 소수부의 자릿수가 크지 않으므로 표현할 수 있는 범위가 적음  부동 소수점  가수부와 지수부로 나누어 표현 부호비트(1비트) - 실수가 음수면 부호비트에 1, 양수면 0 넣음 지수부(8비트) - 정규화 과정에서 얻어낸 지수에 bias를 더한 값 가수부(23비트) - 소수 부분의 값 매우 큰 실수까지 표현 가능 대부분의 시스템에서 사용 중인 방식 오차 발생 가능성  references 👉 https://gguguk.github.io/posts/fixed_point_and_floating_point/","frontmatter":{"date":"August 01, 2023","title":"[CS] 컴퓨터구조 - 고정 소수점 & 부동 소수점","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/fixed_point_and_floating_point/"}},"next":{"id":"105556c0-c89e-5da4-8241-1ab6cb3bbd24","html":"<h1 id=\"패리티-비트--해밍-코드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8C%A8%EB%A6%AC%ED%8B%B0-%EB%B9%84%ED%8A%B8--%ED%95%B4%EB%B0%8D-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"패리티 비트  해밍 코드 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>패리티 비트 &#x26; 해밍 코드</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"패리티-비트-parity-bit\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8C%A8%EB%A6%AC%ED%8B%B0-%EB%B9%84%ED%8A%B8-parity-bit\" aria-label=\"패리티 비트 parity bit permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>패리티 비트 (Parity Bit)</h2>\n<p><strong>정보 전달 과정에서 오류가 생겼는지 검사하기 위해 추가하는 비트</strong> <em>→ 오류 검출</em></p>\n<p>1바이트(8비트) 구조에서 패리티 비트는 7비트 크기의 ASCII 코드를 제외한 나머지 1비트이다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 270px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 68.88888888888889%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"8비트 패리티 코드 구조 테이블\"\n        title=\"8비트 패리티 코드 구조 테이블\"\n        src=\"/static/8c24ddb7bfe586031d7822c71ca1b57d/01bf6/parity_bit.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8c24ddb7bfe586031d7822c71ca1b57d/e9ff0/parity_bit.png 180w,\n/static/8c24ddb7bfe586031d7822c71ca1b57d/01bf6/parity_bit.png 270w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"짝수-패리티\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A7%9D%EC%88%98-%ED%8C%A8%EB%A6%AC%ED%8B%B0\" aria-label=\"짝수 패리티 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>짝수 패리티</h3>\n<p>→ 데이터의 모든 1의 개수를 짝수로 맞춘다</p>\n<h3 id=\"홀수-패리티\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%99%80%EC%88%98-%ED%8C%A8%EB%A6%AC%ED%8B%B0\" aria-label=\"홀수 패리티 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>홀수 패리티</h3>\n<p>→ 데이터의 모든 1의 개수를 홀수로 맞춘다</p>\n<h3 id=\"특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"특징 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>특징</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>2개의 bit 데이터가 손실되면 알아차릴 수 없다.</li>\n<li>오류 검출만 할 뿐 수정하지는 않는다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"해밍-코드-hamming-code\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%B4%EB%B0%8D-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-hamming-code\" aria-label=\"해밍 코드 hamming code permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>해밍 코드 (Hamming Code)</h2>\n<p><strong>데이터 전송 시, 1비트의 오류를 정정할 수 있는 자기 오류정정 코드</strong> <em>→ 오류 정정</em></p>\n<p>패리티 비트를 보고, 1비트에 대한 오류를 정정할 곳을 찾아 수정할 수 있다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 26.666666666666668%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"해밍 코드 테이블\"\n        title=\"해밍 코드 테이블\"\n        src=\"/static/33128eed75e2c5299df5d97568905e84/37523/hamming_code.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/33128eed75e2c5299df5d97568905e84/e9ff0/hamming_code.png 180w,\n/static/33128eed75e2c5299df5d97568905e84/f21e7/hamming_code.png 360w,\n/static/33128eed75e2c5299df5d97568905e84/37523/hamming_code.png 720w,\n/static/33128eed75e2c5299df5d97568905e84/302a4/hamming_code.png 1080w,\n/static/33128eed75e2c5299df5d97568905e84/21b4d/hamming_code.png 1280w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"생성-규칙\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1-%EA%B7%9C%EC%B9%99\" aria-label=\"생성 규칙 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>생성 규칙</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>d</strong>: 데이터 비트 수</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>p</strong>: 패리티 비트 수</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2^p ≥ d + p + 1 를 만족하는 p의 최소 값</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>짝수 패리티의 해밍 코드가 0011011일때, 오류 수정</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>d: 4, p: 3</li>\n<li>2의 n승 번째 자리인 1, 2, 4번째 자릿수가 패리티 비트</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">p1 ⇒ <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">7</span>번째 비트 확인 <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0101</span>로 짝수이므로 <span class=\"token string\">'**0**'</span>\np2 ⇒ <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">7</span>번째 비트 확인 <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0111</span>로 홀수이므로 <span class=\"token string\">'**1**'</span>\np3 ⇒ <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">7</span>번째 비트 확인 <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1011</span>로 홀수이므로 <span class=\"token string\">'**1**'</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>역순으로 패리티비트 ‘110’을 10진법으로 바꾸면 ‘6’이므로 6번째 비트를 수정하면 된다.</p>\n<p>따라서 수정한 데이터는 <strong>0011001</strong>이다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://velog.io/@doonga1406/%ED%8C%A8%EB%A6%AC%ED%8B%B0-%EB%B9%84%ED%8A%B8-%ED%95%B4%EB%B0%8D-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C\">https://velog.io/@doonga1406/%ED%8C%A8%EB%A6%AC%ED%8B%B0-%EB%B9%84%ED%8A%B8-%ED%95%B4%EB%B0%8D-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 01, 2023","title":"[CS] 컴퓨터구조 - 패리티 비트 & 해밍 코드","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/parity_bit_and_hamming_code/"}},"prev":{"id":"ed4c02fe-0093-5478-b0d2-c94ecb7b66c9","html":"<h1 id=\"callback-function\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#callback-function\" aria-label=\"callback function permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Callback Function</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"콜백-함수\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BD%9C%EB%B0%B1-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98\" aria-label=\"콜백 함수 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>콜백 함수</h2>\n<p><strong>콜백함수: 파라미터로 함수를 전달하는 함수</strong></p>\n<p>→ 파라미터로 함수를 전달 받아 함수의 내부에서 실행하는 함수이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">button<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'click'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Button clicked!'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br>\n콜백함수를 사용하는 대표적인 이유는, <strong>동기와 비동기를 함께 썼을 때 순서를 보장</strong>할 수 있기 때문이다. 콜백을 중첩해서 원하는 순서대로 실행하도록 코드를 짤 수도 있다. 콜백이 대표적으로 쓰이는 곳은 <strong>데이터 통신</strong>이다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n  postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">postId</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Post'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n      postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">result</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Comments:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"사용-원칙\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EC%9B%90%EC%B9%99\" aria-label=\"사용 원칙 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용 원칙</h2>\n<h3 id=\"익명-함수-사용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9D%B5%EB%AA%85-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"익명 함수 사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>익명 함수 사용</h3>\n<p>함수의 이름이 없는 익명 함수를 사용한다. 함수의 내부에서 실행되기 때문에 이름을 붙이지 않아도 된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> number <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nnumber<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">forEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">x</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>x <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"함수-이름-전달\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84-%EC%A0%84%EB%8B%AC\" aria-label=\"함수 이름 전달 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>함수 이름 전달</h3>\n<p>자바스크립트는 함수 자체를 객체로서 전달이 가능한 특징이 있기에, 정의해둔 함수를 ()를 붙이지 않고 <strong>함수 이름만 호출 함수의 인자로 전달</strong>하는 방식으로 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">greet</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Hello, '</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">sayHello</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'SeoHyeon'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">callback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 콜백 함수 호출</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token function\">sayHello</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>greet<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// sayHello(greet()); X</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// sayHello(greet); O</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"콜백-지옥\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BD%9C%EB%B0%B1-%EC%A7%80%EC%98%A5\" aria-label=\"콜백 지옥 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>콜백 지옥</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 55.00000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"콜백지옥 장풍\"\n        title=\"콜백지옥 장풍\"\n        src=\"/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/37523/callback_hell.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/e9ff0/callback_hell.png 180w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/f21e7/callback_hell.png 360w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/37523/callback_hell.png 720w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/302a4/callback_hell.png 1080w,\n/static/3db82790ec7cf2b19f12c2dda84b6070/9685e/callback_hell.png 1336w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p><strong>콜백지옥: 콜백 함수가 중첩되어 가독성이 떨어지는 형태</strong></p>\n<p>비동기 호출이 자주 일어나는 경우 콜백 지옥이 발생하기 쉽다. 콜백지옥이 있다면 <strong>가독성이 좋지 않고 유지보수 및 수정이 어려워진다</strong>. 이를 해결하기 위한 방법으로 <strong>promise</strong>와 <strong>async&#x26;await</strong>이 있다.</p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 03, 2023","title":"[Web] JS - Callback Function","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/JS/callback_function/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/fixed_point_and_floating_point/","nextSlug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/parity_bit_and_hamming_code/","prevSlug":"/Web/JS/callback_function/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}